    {
      "command": "tail",
      "description": "Linux下--disable-inotify轮询跟随-n 0时必须跳过启动前完整输入existing\\n，只输出延后追加的added\\n；初始文件完整字节=6578697374696e670a，追加字节=61646465640a，预期stdout完整字节=61646465640a、stderr完整字节=空。",
      "setup_commands": [
        "printf 'existing\\n' > tail-zero-follow.txt; (sleep .3; printf 'added\\n' >> tail-zero-follow.txt) >/dev/null 2>&1 &"
      ],
      "args": ["---disable-inotify", "--sleep-interval=.1", "-n", "0", "-f", "tail-zero-follow.txt"],
      "expectation": {
        "execution": {
          "exit_code": 0,
          "stdout": "added\n",
          "stderr": ""
        },
        "ignore_fields": {
          "ignore_exit_code": true
        }
      },
      "timeout": 2,
      "cleanup_commands": ["rm -f tail-zero-follow.txt"],
      "tags": ["linux", "follow", "polling", "zero-count"]
    },
    {
      "command": "tail",
      "description": "Linux下--disable-inotify轮询跟随检测到文件长度从696e697469616c0a缩短为61667465720a且mtime恢复为旧值时，必须按GNU规则报告截断并从起点输出after\\n；预期stdout完整字节=61667465720a，stderr为tail: tail-truncate-mtime.txt: file truncated\\n。",
      "setup_commands": [
        "printf 'initial\\n' > tail-truncate-mtime.txt; old=$(stat -c %y tail-truncate-mtime.txt); (sleep .3; : > tail-truncate-mtime.txt; touch -d \"$old\" tail-truncate-mtime.txt; printf 'after\\n' > tail-truncate-mtime.txt; touch -d \"$old\" tail-truncate-mtime.txt) >/dev/null 2>&1 &"
      ],
      "args": ["---disable-inotify", "--sleep-interval=.1", "-n", "0", "-f", "tail-truncate-mtime.txt"],
      "expectation": {
        "execution": {
          "exit_code": 0,
          "stdout": "after\n",
          "stderr": "tail: tail-truncate-mtime.txt: file truncated\n"
        },
        "ignore_fields": {
          "ignore_exit_code": true
        }
      },
      "timeout": 2,
      "cleanup_commands": ["rm -f tail-truncate-mtime.txt"],
      "tags": ["linux", "follow", "polling", "truncation", "mtime"]
    },
    {
      "command": "tail",
      "description": "Linux下--disable-inotify配合默认--follow=descriptor时，重命名tail-descriptor-a.txt为tail-descriptor-b.txt后仍须只读取原文件描述符的追加字节6f6c642d66696c650a，不得切换到随后重建路径写入的6e65772d66696c650a；预期stdout完整字节=6f6c642d66696c650a，stderr完整字节=空。",
      "setup_commands": [
        "printf 'initial\\n' > tail-descriptor-a.txt; (sleep .3; mv tail-descriptor-a.txt tail-descriptor-b.txt; printf 'old-file\\n' >> tail-descriptor-b.txt; sleep .3; printf 'new-file\\n' > tail-descriptor-a.txt) >/dev/null 2>&1 &"
      ],
      "args": ["---disable-inotify", "--sleep-interval=.1", "-n", "0", "-f", "tail-descriptor-a.txt"],
      "expectation": {
        "execution": {
          "exit_code": 0,
          "stdout": "old-file\n",
          "stderr": ""
        },
        "ignore_fields": {
          "ignore_exit_code": true
        }
      },
      "timeout": 2,
      "cleanup_commands": ["rm -f tail-descriptor-a.txt tail-descriptor-b.txt"],
      "tags": ["linux", "follow", "descriptor", "polling", "rename"]
    },
    {
      "command": "tail",
      "description": "Linux下--disable-inotify --follow=name的--max-unchanged-stats=1必须重新检查内容和mtime均未变化的路径替换：将736565640a移动后以相同字节和旧mtime重建，预期从新文件输出736565640a，并输出tail: 'tail-name-recheck.txt' has been replaced;  following new file\\n。",
      "setup_commands": [
        "printf 'seed\\n' > tail-name-recheck.txt; old=$(stat -c %y tail-name-recheck.txt); (sleep .3; mv tail-name-recheck.txt tail-name-recheck-old.txt; printf 'seed\\n' > tail-name-recheck.txt; touch -d \"$old\" tail-name-recheck.txt) >/dev/null 2>&1 &"
      ],
      "args": ["---disable-inotify", "--follow=name", "--sleep-interval=.1", "--max-unchanged-stats=1", "-n", "0", "tail-name-recheck.txt"],
      "expectation": {
        "execution": {
          "exit_code": 0,
          "stdout": "seed\n",
          "stderr": "tail: 'tail-name-recheck.txt' has been replaced;  following new file\n"
        },
        "ignore_fields": {
          "ignore_exit_code": true
        }
      },
      "timeout": 2,
      "cleanup_commands": ["rm -f tail-name-recheck.txt tail-name-recheck-old.txt"],
      "tags": ["linux", "follow", "name", "polling", "max-unchanged-stats"]
    },
    {
